DESCRIPTION:BEKSCITY RUN CLUB — Run and Splash\nCategory: Monthly Signature Event\nDistrict: ALL DISTRICTS\nMeeting Point: TBC\nDistance: 6 km\nRoute Stops: 2 water splash checkpoints\nSponsor: Breakfast Club\, Enny's Kitchen\, Fruit Oasis\, Cozy Bites\nPartners: Soakers\, Archers Live\n\nPLANNED ACTIVITIES:\nHigh energy club run\, hydration splash zones\, and recovery drills.\n\nABOUT THIS RUN:\nRun and Splash in special collaboration with Soakers. An exhilarating group run with designated hydration checkpoints and post-run cool down activities themed around Halloween.\n\nSTANDARD SCHEDULE:\n• 06:45 AM — Check-in and gathering\n• 07:00 AM — Warm-up session\n• 07:15 AM — Group run departs\n• 08:15 AM — Cooldown & stretching\n• 08:30 AM — Refreshments & community social\n\nBEKSCITY RUN CLUB | Keep Moving Forward
